SUMMARY:Ashevillish Collab Release Party
DESCRIPTION:We’re teaming up with our longtime friend Ryan of Ashevillish for a release that celebrates everything we love about this town!\nOver the past few years\, Ryan has used his platform to shine a light on Asheville\, introducing tens of thousands of followers to the small businesses\, makers\, and stories that make this place special. So when the opportunity arose to collab with Ryan\, we couldn’t say no.\n\nCome grab a can of the Blackberry Limeade collab\, hang out\, grab a bite from the food truck\, dance to DJs spinning all afternoon\, and watch live screen printing by Asheville Printing Company of Ashevillish limited edition shirts\, made fresh on-site while you wait.\n\nAnd\, of course\, in true community fashion\, a portion of proceeds from this collab supports Asheville City Schools\, Ryan’s own alma mater\, a small way of investing back into the community that raised him\, and that he’s spent years showing up for.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/ashevillish-collab-release-party/
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Food Truck,Free & Fun!,Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/908c882b-84a8-4c13-b7db-70b5f27dc069.jpeg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=f2907bd5b19db2455b1fe868271d2ff6
END:VEVENT
