SUMMARY:Rattle Creek BBQ Food Truck
DESCRIPTION:Rattle Creek BBQ is a smoked-meat food truck\, bringing Texas BBQ to the mountains with the flavors of his Mexican heritage.\n\nBefore Asheville\, owner Mat cooked in Austin\, where he picked up a deep respect for low-and-slow brisket and a love for bright\, fresh food creating the ultimate balanced meal. \nRattle Creek’s menu includes BBQ plates\, sandwiches\, and tacos\, featuring brisket\, spare ribs\, and pulled pork\, plus sides like guajillo crunch slaw\, elote corn salad\, and queso mac & cheese.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/rattle-creek-bbq/
CATEGORIES:Food Truck
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/Screenshot-2026-10-09-at-1.54.18-PM.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=a6e7f649ec177dab30445a098e8691fd
END:VEVENT
