SUMMARY:Third Annual Beatles Hymn Sing with House of Mercy
DESCRIPTION:It’s Time to Come Together!\nJoin us\, and our dear friends House of Mercy\, for a live band sing-a-long featuring music from the grand portfolio of The Beatles! This gathering welcomes all voices\, ages\, and lovers of music. Don’t miss the magic of singing as once voice and creating light and loving energy through the iconic and beautifully touching lyrics of The Beatles. \nFree to Attend. \nYear after year\, we’ve witnessed this event grow and radiate joy further and further into the community. Come be a part of the magic! \n 
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/third-annual-beatles-hymn-sing-with-house-of-mercy/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/Orange-and-Red-Vintage-Music-Festival-Poster.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=ac052cbfc67ff8cd7257f1fc2b814fc2
END:VEVENT
