SUMMARY:October Makers Market & Plant Bingo
DESCRIPTION:Sprout & Bloom & Travelin’ Market Club Team Up at The Mule\nJoin us on Saturday October 17th for an afternoon of shopping local vendors and playing Plant Bingo! Free to attend\, bingo cards for purchase through Sprout & Bloom. \nMarket opens at 1pm. Bingo at 2pm. \nThis event is scheduled to take place outdoors. \n 
