SUMMARY:Halloween Pawty with Ruff Life AVL
DESCRIPTION:Doggie Halloween Party!\nJoin Ruff Life AVL for an afternoon for the pups! They’ll run a costume contest\, trick contest\, and paper plate race. Asheville’s favorite dog-centric vendors will be here like Pawsitive Bakes & Auntie M’s Pet Care. The event benefits Charlie’s Angels Animal Rescue\, so get dressed up and come support a great cause. \n 
