SUMMARY:NFL Sundays at The Mule
DESCRIPTION:Football is Back!\nAnd you know we’re throwin’ it on the big screen and bar TVs all season long. Come on down on Sundays for drink specials\, delicious food\, and a front row for all the action. \nPlease note: The big screen will not be available for all games and game times each Sunday. Our events calendar will reflect what else we have happening!\n 
