SUMMARY:Live Music: Captain's Choice
DESCRIPTION:Captain’s Choice Debuts at The Mule!\nJoin us for an afternoon of Yacht Rock & 80’s favorites from Asheville band\, Captain’s Choice! Captain’s Choice was born from a love for the smooth\, sun-drenched sounds of Yacht Rock and the infectious energy of interactive entertainment. We blend the sophistication of a live band and the competitive thrill of digital trivia. Whether you’re on a deck or in a ballroom\, we bring the wind-in-your-hair vibes and the ultimate party atmosphere to every voyage. \nCaptain’s hats and boat attire encouraged! \nFree to attend. All ages.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/live-music-captains-choice/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/IG-1025-Cpatains-choice-1.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=dddab0b26be50032fc1b0750061a596e
END:VEVENT
